  "display_title": "Demon in Mount Hua",
  "description": "The Murim’s public enemy, the Slaughterer Demon Monarch, Yeom Se-Ak! It’s been a hundred years since he was trapped in Mount Hua after being captured by the Sword God, Han Ho. He waited all these years for his chance to seek revenge…\n\nThe long period of time caused this incident to be forgotten by the world, and eventually, even the Yeom Se-Ak was forgotten. However...\n\n“Sir, what is your name…?”\nA coincidental meeting, and the name of an archenemy that he said unwittingly, “H-Han Ho.”\n\nAt the end of a vain journey, an unexpected path branches out. The ultimate demon that’s in Mount Hua, Yeom Se-Ak’s choice!\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
